  "body": "The other day I learned about https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7838#section-5. It lacks Fetch integration. What happens if a web developer sets that header and later the browser wants to set it for some reason? Does the browser override, append, or fail the request?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/http @martinthomson ",
